<title>CANADA: United Grain lawsuit hearing set Thursday.</title>
<headline>United Grain lawsuit hearing set Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A court hearing on United Grain Growers Ltd's shareholder rights plan and ability to issue new shares was rescheduled on Tuesday to be held in a Winnipeg court on Thursday, UGG lawyer Chris Martin said.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
